          "fase": 0,
          "animacion": null,
          "puntos": [
            {
              "frases": [
                "I never thought my dead heart could beat faster, but your presence stirs something within me."
              ],
              "opciones": []
            },
            {
              "frases": [
                "Even in decay, the wind carries your scent, a reminder of life I once knew."
              ],
              "opciones": []
            }
          ],
          "pista": null
        },
        {
          "fase": 1,
          "animacion": null,
          "puntos": [
            {
              "frases": [
                "Your hair flutters like a living flag, and for a moment I feel less like a monster."
              ],
              "opciones": []
            },
            {
              "frases": [
                "If I could, I would shield you from the storm that follows us."
